infographic compare-hierarchy-row-letter-card-rounded-rect-node
data
  title Three failure legs of at-least-once
  compares
    - label Leg 1 — Producer to broker
      children
        - label Lost ack → producer retries
        - label Result: duplicate at the broker
        - label Caught at broker (idempotent producer / config)
    - label Leg 2 — Broker durability
      children
        - label Crash before replicate → message lost
        - label Result: silent loss (misconfig)
        - label Caught at broker (acks=all / SQS default)
    - label Leg 3 — Broker to consumer
      children
        - label Crash after process, before ack → redeliver
        - label Result: side effect runs twice (double charge)
        - label Only the idempotent consumer catches it
theme
  palette #f59e0b #f43f5e #6366f1
